{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09903","headline":"送薛弁归河东 · 岑参","name":"送薛弁归河东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薛侯故乡处，五老峰西头。\n归路秦树灭，到乡河水流。\n看君马首去，满耳蝉声愁。\n献赋今未售，读书凡几秋。\n应过伯夷庙，爲上关城楼。\n楼上能相忆，西南指雍州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}